{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸命世尊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三世，亦云三界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最殊勝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世尊。已上第一歸敬尊德門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所謂之義，即說之義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三身無見頂相義。已上第二影表法身門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普遍照曜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舒遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六種稠林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自然清淨。已上第三淨除惡趣門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "灌頂我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善逝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殊勝言教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甘露，又云灌頂不死句"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唯願攝受，攝受攝受，又三遍攘勝諸苦惱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅住持壽命。已上第四善明灌頂門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如虛空清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最勝清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "千光明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "驚覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切如來神力所加持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "印契"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛鉤鎖身清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切障清淨也。所謂業障報障煩惱障也，得清淨云云。已上第五神力加持門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "壽命增長，皆得清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "誓願加持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世寶，亦云法寶，所謂福惠二種資糧。已上第六壽命增長門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真如實際遍滿清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "顯現智惠清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最勝最勝，即是真俗二諦法門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念持定惠相應。已上第七定惠相應門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切諸佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮毘婆尸如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮尸棄如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮毘沙浮如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮拘樓孫如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮拘那含牟尼如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮迦葉如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮尺迦牟尼如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "敬禮聖觀自在菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "加持清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "金剛藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "願成金剛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是我之義，自稱姓名。為他人即稱他姓名。已上第八金剛供養門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切有情身得清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切趣皆清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切如來安慰令得加持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所覺所覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能令覺悟，能令有情速得覺悟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普遍清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切如來神力所加持"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大印，所謂如來大印。已上第九普證清淨門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吉祥之句。又云成就之義。已上第十成就涅槃門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0973_p0377b11"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T19n0973_p0373a07"}
{"id": null, "n": "0384008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0384008", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】東寺三密藏古寫本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0384c0101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0384c0101", "type": "add", "text": "􄙪【CB】，􄙢【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0384c0701", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0384c0701", "type": "add", "text": "􄗚【CB】，􄚩【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0385b1901", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0385b1901", "type": "add", "text": "􈁺【CB】，􄦾【大】"}
